{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goobies 2 is a third-person, co-op roguelike where you battle endless waves of blobs and bosses while travelling through the Blobverse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/85b03bd511fe710ea7632c0eeaffc8af.poster.avif?t=1763974279\" width=674 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/85b03bd511fe710ea7632c0eeaffc8af.webm?t=1763974279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/85b03bd511fe710ea7632c0eeaffc8af.mp4?t=1763974279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goobies come in all shapes and forms, each with unique abilities and playstyles. Choose from the original squad or discover new beings of goo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with an enchanted Orb to shoot foes. Each Orb is unique and behaves differently based on its enchantment. Some are even sentient and have a will of their own!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7514f47f9a88c9ecd82e945e516d5dfa.avif?t=1763974279\" width=854 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful Omens that evolve with new properties as they grow in number. Does your build call for a Venomous Flask or a Prickly Meteorite?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565090?t=1763974279","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/2b78adeadfa50a834a721d11804cc0edbe542c7e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763974279","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/4aaf5f1aea45018cc2fb97e5cdee0fda6efca3f4/caps